        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1029e8526fb3358b345ea238",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星的跟班B",
      "source_fingerprint": "e23d355bce40799e78a221aa72b507e077ae74438545979946b631de60a67534",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4219dc9cef68c4b757b432c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知道她自己有没有发现，\n但那说法听起来就像在捧鲁道夫会长呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddda3602f970a353605bef6a593bae7c10e8b3a339302fc728f1b231a0b46f5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b2efa0a7cbfe9fd1fc21705",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的内心期待着能和\n鲁道夫象征一起在国外大闹一场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75031a76ae6add08ec77803a076515a3e8a149c11997d6c6dd136eea32e0bb1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6affffbb3a6d03936da97c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征的目标一直都是进军国外，\n因此她也做了很多调查，\n应该相当了解国外的水准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b8ffbcbfe34ac9edab3c96e7f383d273412aed6d5718f28c8be29e1a55b5150",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de44a6e76977b0c5daaeae4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是……\n我持续着每天下班后去台球场的日子──",
      "source_fingerprint": "549e2ee0e89b5ceb3f1fd6e4f314306851edf30c2dc4f75be290891bc38df43e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd451cd52ede3b05ade0d56a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以要是不是真心承认对方的实力，\n她是不会说出这种话的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ddd110b609be4a5182936844c0ef792222bfd3225754be41343ba91ab16be1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6648d10e61bd65e2cf76b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说……\n她打从心底认为──\n“鲁道夫象征的跑法是有价值的”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87670684700514659f7e995a40b6d8f053da52c36e28c27a0c382a23ec56d3c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6be8d83b2a3b4c424f3d7d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12531aa66449e41690d6124b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我现在──只想把“那家伙”取得的\n辉煌功绩全部涂改掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de02f365868c6ffb442efd8c536eb4e2f08c88f7ef959f1e66179653669c113b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1930ee5eea1ed0bbd2d94ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35535cf0b08af9b64ec7353b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算乞求我跟她比赛，我也敬谢不敏。\n那家伙已经没有这种价值了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43586512f51d73934687ebbbe51fe5d67383c765e1dccbfefc4cba5ab8dd6f56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3905129f178a79862dc4f60c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说的那些果然都不是真心话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c4495337530b1e25fb52ece4617ca1d025903a8e3962bdf5e9308c13284ecb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e548986ad4adc77914cc5d9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──她致力避免“正面对决”。\n其中原因是“因为没有价值”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1796c9841e57e599175bb0167044c4a128ce14ee75f45d9e3b8a110cc663970a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:677d9f2ce459c540602bd85b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，\n其实她并不觉得“没有价值”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb3caf89788fdce2df1a1875a59de2440999e54330678ebb8779773772b0cb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b25770811bd3fbbaf1326121",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为什么她会抱持着\n如此复杂的心情呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "523125965efbf6cff2f540bb1fdebd9bb4a4bd141b04fe87f4bb2c094a42f0e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33a063f2e24edccfb09186e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我突然想起了之前的臆测。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d2a063bd72e995b873fdedb48ab8d6655fed5622c9fbe9b8179c8dfd8c7c1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cddf4a6957284e6ec68aeec6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今对方已与当年憧憬的模样大不相同。\n当她看到那样的鲁道夫象征时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "997f9682db9284ec2214ef6dce4a1fd73b473859135ffff16f2a66e1384c6525",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7db0956c5df3aab17ca30bf4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拜托你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8e7dc297e7bc3137af4cb009b71b987257f8c40869efd4df9a1e4d2bf82f5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4e23a8607364e199149bf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "台球教练",
      "source_fingerprint": "39140e245422b9e53db5ed2887037c3e76d92c1d6d0d6238cee397bc7a75838b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d35b998aa1724a8d96ffd5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以说你的程度差不多算中级者？\n然是这次是想在短时间内提升实力？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0cb1117aa3073b355243dfdbb6c74da60a365480f70e6acf821c53688bc15cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d8fb90eb205a7561768200",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "应该很希望她能\n“变回原来的样子”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff360bd033f0625b1464b4f5e9b50da1d9338c2bf8a5001867ee174631055c19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95062e8b2a0845907197c794",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也很希望能够\n“变回像从前那样的关系”吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "64cc6a9be1051e6034cfb07fad75df7878e5d5a3497c3a5cc64d027b6135d882",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eda6e4944decf8fb52910d72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果说这些臆测全都正确的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9313c0be2f4f73479031b3cb844bb1a21c9154c272e5cc22e65cfc10f29fa1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c27b877cdaba146118fd13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管她内心深处希望\n“变回原来的样子”跟“变回从前的关系”，\n但却努力压抑着自己的感情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f3248d9ec0f6164d689e632cd902830c14a58540ca9b54cdfb2b1f768613423",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
